  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uzbekistan: Strengthening Trade Integration and Partnership through GSP+ and the Country Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this Action is to contribute to sustainable economic and trade relations between the EU and Uzbekistan through i) fostering a more transparent and conducive environment that optimizes the implementation and utilisation of trade priorities under the GSP+ and, II) enhancing more aligned efforts towards strategic reforms, while maximising economic benefits for Uzbekistan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
